{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10383","headline":"同吕判官从哥舒大夫破洪济城廻登积石军多福七级浮图 · 高适","name":"同吕判官从哥舒大夫破洪济城廻登积石军多福七级浮图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞口连浊河，辕门对山寺。\n宁知鞍马上，独有登临事。\n七级凌太清，千崖列苍翠。\n飘飘方寓目，想像见深意。\n高兴殊未平，凉风飒然至。\n拔城阵云合，转斾胡星坠。\n大将何英灵，官军动天地。\n君怀生羽翼，本欲附骐骥。\n款段苦不前，清冥信难致。\n一歌阳春後，三叹终自愧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}